  "description": "Hardtail MTB for serious young rippers.\nScaled down modern geometry fine tuned in co-operation with our youth team riders, that offers same quality ride for kids as the bigger versions of the Eccentric line.\nGet your kids addicted to MTB and share the stoke together on the same rides.\nThey can progress fast without being HELD back, and explore NEW trails with confidence.\nMAIN FEATURES:\n- Tough and light alloy frame w/New-school kid's geometry\n- Properly scaled-down modern geo with slack angles\n- Manitou Machete Comp, 100mm travel, 15mm thru axle, air spring,\n- Hydrualic Rebound & Compression Adjust\n- Hydraulic disc brakes\n- Sturdy GX 10s drivetrain\n- High volume fast-rolling tires",
